WEBVTT

00:00:00.383 --> 00:00:01.932
How much can I spend this week?

00:00:02.566 --> 00:00:04.611
Say you have eight hundred and eighty pounds

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.398
after bills for the next four weeks.

00:00:06.932 --> 00:00:09.771
Keep eighty pounds in Buffer for occasional costs.

00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:12.004
That leaves two hundred pounds a week.

00:00:14.421 --> 00:00:17.707
You can adjust the amounts or dates before you start.

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:20.255
When your next transfer is due,

00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:22.438
move the money in your banking app,

00:00:22.774 --> 00:00:25.166
then record the transfer in Spending Plan.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.242
There’s no need to enter everyday purchases.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.291
What if you need an extra forty pounds this week?

00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:35.169
Tap Top up and enter the amount.

00:00:35.604 --> 00:00:36.855
With two weeks left,

00:00:37.092 --> 00:00:39.832
you can bring twenty pounds forward from week three

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.015
and another twenty from week four.

00:00:42.302 --> 00:00:43.255
Check the preview.

00:00:43.547 --> 00:00:46.485
Both later weeks now show a hundred and eighty pounds.

00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:49.363
Your eighty pounds in Buffer stays put.

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:51.050
If that works for you,

00:00:51.436 --> 00:00:53.729
move the forty pounds in your banking app,

00:00:54.015 --> 00:00:55.515
then record the transfer.

00:00:58.059 --> 00:01:00.650
You could also use Buffer for an occasional cost.

00:01:01.135 --> 00:01:03.279
That leaves your later weeks as planned.

00:01:04.131 --> 00:01:07.863
Spending Plan, your weekly spending companion.
